# Environment Variables Template

## 🔐 Backend Environment Variables (Render)

Copy paste ini ke Render Dashboard → Environment:

```env
# ============================================
# NODE ENVIRONMENT
# ============================================
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3001

# ============================================
# DATABASE (Neon PostgreSQL)
# ============================================
# GANTI dengan connection string dari Neon dashboard
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST/DATABASE?sslmode=require&channel_binding=require

# ============================================
# JWT SECRETS
# ============================================
# ⚠️ WAJIB GANTI! Generate random string min 32 characters
# PowerShell: -join ((65..90) + (97..122) + (48..57) | Get-Random -Count 32 | % {[char]$_})
JWT_SECRET=GENERATE_NEW_SECRET_HERE_MIN_32_CHARS
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=GENERATE_NEW_REFRESH_SECRET_HERE_MIN_32_CHARS

# ============================================
# CLOUDFLARE R2 STORAGE
# ============================================
# Dari Cloudflare R2 Dashboard
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your_r2_account_id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_r2_access_key_id
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your_r2_secret_access_key
R2_BUCKET_NAME=lms-abk-storage
R2_PUBLIC_URL=https://your_account_id.r2.cloudflarestorage.com

# ============================================
# CORS & FRONTEND URL
# ============================================
# URL frontend Vercel (update setelah deploy frontend)
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app
```

---

## 🌐 Frontend Environment Variables (Vercel)

Add di Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables:

```env
# ============================================
# BACKEND API URL
# ============================================
# URL backend Render (update setelah deploy backend)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://lms-backend-xxxx.onrender.com/graphql
```

