## 📋 Checklist Setup Environment Variables

### Backend (Render)
- [ ] NODE_ENV set to `production`
- [ ] PORT set to `3001`
- [ ] DATABASE_URL from Neon (with ?sslmode=require)
- [ ] JWT_SECRET generated (NEW, not from guide!)
- [ ] JWT_REFRESH_SECRET generated (NEW, not from guide!)
- [ ] R2_ACCOUNT_ID from Cloudflare
- [ ] R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID from Cloudflare
- [ ] R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY from Cloudflare
- [ ] R2_BUCKET_NAME set to bucket name
- [ ] R2_PUBLIC_URL from Cloudflare
- [ ] NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL set to Vercel frontend URL

### Frontend (Vercel)
- [ ] NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL set to Render backend URL + /graphql

