## 🔑 How to Get Each Value

### DATABASE_URL (Neon)
```
1. Login to https://console.neon.tech
2. Select your project
3. Dashboard → Connection Details
4. Copy "Connection string"
5. Pastikan ada ?sslmode=require di akhir URL
```

### JWT_SECRET & JWT_REFRESH_SECRET
```powershell
# Generate di PowerShell:
-join ((65..90) + (97..122) + (48..57) | Get-Random -Count 32 | % {[char]$_})

# Atau online:
https://generate-secret.vercel.app/32
```

### R2 Credentials (Cloudflare)
```
1. Login to https://dash.cloudflare.com
2. R2 → Manage R2 API Tokens
3. Create API Token with "Object Read & Write" permission
4. Copy:
   - Account ID (dari URL atau Settings)
   - Access Key ID
   - Secret Access Key
5. Bucket name: lms-abk-storage (atau nama bucket kamu)
6. Public URL format: https://{ACCOUNT_ID}.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
```

### Frontend & Backend URLs
```
Backend URL: Dari Render dashboard setelah deploy
Format: https://lms-backend-xxxx.onrender.com

Frontend URL: Dari Vercel dashboard setelah deploy
Format: https://your-app.vercel.app
```

