## 🔄 Update Environment Variables

### Render
```
1. Dashboard → Your Service
2. Environment tab
3. Edit variable
4. Save Changes
5. Service will auto-redeploy
```

### Vercel
```
1. Dashboard → Your Project
2. Settings → Environment Variables
3. Edit variable
4. Save
5. Redeploy: Deployments → ... → Redeploy
```

